### Button with Icon
```tsx
<Button variant="basic-secondary" size="small-icon">
  <TrashIcon className="size-6" />
</Button>
```

### Input with States
```tsx
<Input
  type="text"
  state="error"
  label="Label"
  description="Error message"
  placeholder="Enter text"
/>
```

### Layout Structure
```tsx
<div className="flex flex-col gap-[72px]">
  <Breadcrumbs items={[...]} />
  <div className="flex gap-[32px] items-start">
    <h1 className="font-istok-web font-bold text-heading-32 text-text-dark">
      Title
    </h1>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Spacing Conventions
- Large sections: `gap-[72px]` or `gap-[40px]`
- Component spacing: `gap-[32px]` or `gap-[24px]`
- Small gaps: `gap-[10px]` or `gap-[4px]`
- Padding: `px-[120px]` for main content, `px-[16px]` for components

